{"text":"娣女。景明三年六月廿三日，□□□□□郭□子、唯那尹愛姜、唯那張雙□、□□□□妙姿、王容、王午好、楊醜姜、郭容、劉豊、王□、□轉好、王足、趙尹娥容、鄭桃、胡歎鄉、尹醜姜、尹醜女、程□妙、尹□海、尹陵姜等廿一人，各爲七世父母、所生眷屬。亡者生天，生者福德，□□□彌勒一區。普爲終生，咸同此願。","tags":[{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"維那","refId":null,"text":"唯那","start":22,"end":24},{"name":"PersonName","term":"尹愛姜","refId":null,"text":"尹愛姜","start":24,"end":27},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"維那","refId":null,"text":"唯那","start":28,"end":30},{"name":"PersonName","term":"張雙","refId":null,"text":"張雙","start":30,"end":32},{"name":"PersonName","term":"王容","refId":null,"text":"王容","start":41,"end":43},{"name":"PersonName","term":"王午好","refId":null,"text":"王午好","start":44,"end":47},{"name":"PersonName","term":"楊醜姜","refId":null,"text":"楊醜姜","start":48,"end":51},{"name":"PersonName","term":"郭容","refId":null,"text":"郭容","start":52,"end":54},{"name":"PersonName","term":"劉豊","refId":null,"text":"劉豊","start":55,"end":57},{"name":"PersonName","term":"王足","refId":null,"text":"王足","start":65,"end":67},{"name":"PersonName","term":"趙尹娥容","refId":null,"text":"趙尹娥容","start":68,"end":72},{"name":"PersonName","term":"鄭桃","refId":null,"text":"鄭桃","start":73,"end":75},{"name":"PersonName","term":"胡歎鄉","refId":null,"text":"胡歎鄉","start":76,"end":79},{"name":"PersonName","term":"尹醜姜","refId":null,"text":"尹醜姜","start":80,"end":83},{"name":"PersonName","term":"尹醜女","refId":null,"text":"尹醜女","start":84,"end":87},{"name":"PersonName","term":"尹陵姜等廿一人","refId":null,"text":"尹陵姜等廿一人","start":96,"end":103},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"彌勒","refId":null,"text":"彌勒","start":129,"end":131},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"眾生","refId":null,"text":"終生","start":136,"end":138}]}